N10 G0 X0 Y0 Z0
N20 G1 X10 Y20 F100
N25 X[#1+10] Y[#2+20]
N30 M3 S1000
N40 G2 X[#<var>] Y30 I5 J5
N50 M5
N55 M6 T1
N60 M30
N70 WHILE [#<var> LT 100] DO
N80 G1 X10 Y20 F100
N85 IF [#<var> EQ 100] THEN
N86 GOTO 100
N87 ELSEIF [#<var> EQ 200] THEN
N88 GOTO 200
N89 ELSE
N90 GOTO 300
N91 ENDIF
N92 GOTO 300
N93 END
N100 O100 WHILE [#<var> LT 100] DO
N110 G1 X10 Y20 F100
N120 O111 IF [#<var> EQ 100] THEN
N130 GOTO 100
N140 O111 ELSEIF [#<var> EQ 200] THEN
N150 GOTO 200
N160 O111 ELSE
N170 GOTO 300
N180 O111 ENDIF
N190 GOTO 300
N200 O100 END
N210 M30